L '## Step 341: the guard''s stop'
L ''
E 'Within 35 minutes of the release''s end: the observer''s `edges.log` shows `agentspace.windows-amd64 running -> stopped`, at most 25 minutes after the release (D56: the grace, 15 minutes, plus 10); guard.log''s new lines include `host=agentspace.windows-amd64 stopped since=...` and none `failed` or `sign-in has expired` (an `unexplained` line before the stop is expected); the read-only `describe-instances` answers one row, `stopped` and `Client.UserInitiatedShutdown` (an API stop, the guard''s; `Client.InstanceInitiatedShutdown` would be the host''s own power-off). The step exits 6 when windows/amd64''s hours reach 4.5, 3 at the 35-minute bound.'
